- As the chi-squared statistic of 2.14 is [less]{color=#FF00CC} than critical value of 7.82, we [fail to reject]{color=#FF00CC} the null hypothesis and conclude that the genes are [unlinked]{color=#FF00CC}.

- *&#61539;2 = Sum*

- *2.142*

